    {
      "stage": "LeakResponse",
      "cue": "23_ContainerClosedTaskCompleted",
      "text": "오염 폐기물 용기가 밀폐되었습니다. 염산 누출 대응 절차가 완료되었습니다.",
      "audio": "Assets/Resources/TrainingNarration/LeakResponse/23_ContainerClosedTaskCompleted.mp3",
      "sha256": "7e1a0e38b63343bc4e1931fea2da445cfb429bfd49f82395c791b7a99744d5a4"
