      "audio": "Assets/Resources/TrainingNarration/PPE/06_GripSelectThenEquip.mp3",
      "sha256": "6ac347fc2f1750856ba1f07db6e3fb042fbf274c18545f09696a005a08c29e2c"
    },
    {
      "stage": "PPE",
      "cue": "07_BButtonCancel",
      "text": "잘못 놓친 장비는 원래 위치로 돌아갑니다.",
